    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoahasi sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu buuneeda bea ng'eanyiida Yehoahasi was orjeeda Yosiya ak geanung' ghoah sugoocheanda aba hoorgeeda ghwaan aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahasi abeeda gaba gweanyeew diktam ea samwagu damanda ang'eada gheambalmeeda; ng'ata goombaliischi sheeh samwagu aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak sugoocheanda Misri gooruuteawa niny Yerusalemu ak ghawal ng'eanyiida dalaantaji bughala bea lapiya ea dalaanteanagi bea dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanung' sugoocheanda Misri ghoah orjeeda geenyea Yehoahasi siguura Eliyakimu sugoocheanda jea ghoahaaghwa Yuda ea Yerusalemu, ng'ata ghwayam gheawungaaschi sugoocheanda Misri ak geeguura Yehoyakimu; ng'ata gageanda Neko orjeeda geenyea Yehoyakimu siguura Yehoahasi ak ghwaat Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakimu sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakimu abeeda gaba gweanyeew diktam ea muut damanda ang'eada gheambalmeedean, hean goombaliischi gweanyeew damwanagi aba Yerusalemu. Ng'ata gwasin ng'asheega munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaan sugoocheanda Babeli siguura Nebukadinesa, ak ghwarat aba munyooloalajeega ak ghwaat Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Nebukadinesa ghwaat Babeli dabita mwaatkwa bea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak goodiing'da aba jeedeaba gheanyi aba Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean muudeanooda gadiyoojiga Yehoyakimu, ea munyinda ghayi sin, geeng'oorsa jeeda gitaabooda sugoodiga Israeli ea Yuda; ak gawa goombaliischi aba hoorgeadaanyi orjeedaanyi siguura Yehoyakini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakini sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakini abeeda gaba gweanyeew damasis ang'eada gheambalmeeda, ng'ata goombaliischi sheeh samwagu ea eawooji damanamughuush aba Yerusalemu. Hean gwasin ng'asheega munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean doomeelda gweayda sugoocheanda was Nebukadinesa goojeakta giijasoodiga ak geanung' eeyeadu niny Babeli, ea haleanjeeda haw shaayaat bea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghwanung' ghoah sugoocheanda jea ghoahaaghwa Yuda ea Yerusalemu orjeeda ghaamwat siguura Sedekiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sedekiya sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sedekiya abeeda gaba gweanyeew diktam ea agi damanda ang'eada gheambalmeedean, ng'ata goombaliischi gweanyeew damanagi aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin ng'asheega munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI. Nea ea mwaada geaw ng'eanyi aba madeeda sibaneeda siguura Yeremiya, was dea baloola ghuuta NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giibeedeayda Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoang'aamwa geaw heeda sugoocheanda siguura Nebukadinesa ghayi nung' ghwaak habeawooda aba gheawunga ASEETA; hean ghoahang'waay gheataanyi ea gurooroadaanyi aba biiksiinda NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara ashoohoodiga hees ea buuneeda sean gaminda gwasin ng'asheega mii doobiiweadi, nea ghwaduup munyasnacheeka eemoojiga, ng'ata ghang'uda ririnnyeanda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi niighaydiit aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa, goojeaksa saawa giijasoodiga, aba gideaba nibwayda fugaaschi ea heeda abiita niny; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak saawa gaminda gwajuuga giijasoodiga ASEETA, nea gafool ng'asheagaaschi, ak gabara reari sibangaaschi, bwak ea goobissa nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA heeda fugaaschi, bwak ea eamudu gwanda siida jea ghaghu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeagu ASEETA sugoocheanda Galdayo, ak ghabwar gheareemanga aba ng'uta aba jeeda gheeda nyaawa ghaydit, nea ea mabwayda gheareemanga ghana haweega miyeasat, ea gweargwa ghana fuga woosi; hean ghwaahaak sean jeeda geatingaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara haleanjeeda gheeda ASEETA, gea hees ea gea manang'i, ea gheaseeda sugoocheanda ea fugaaschi hees, hean aba giteena ghwaat Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojoon beasta gheeda ASEETA, ak gwanyarja ghamarda Yerusalemu, ak ghaghwarda eara gealgaaschi aba beasta, ak ghwadatas haleanjeadaanyi sean haw shaayaat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaat Babeli ghoah giing'oonyanga fuga was boosteanga aba heeda ng'uta, ak ghoah fuga gadiyeeda aba headaanyi ea heeda orjoagaaschi bwak ea ghang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda fuga Ajemi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghwahita damanda ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA aba ghuuta Yeremiya, bwak ea gahoosasa ng'eanyiida sabaatohajeagaaschi. Aba gideaba eemoojiga mideawa geatin ghoang'waayi sabaato, ghoanyiit gweanyeew laadam ea damanamughuush.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Goreshi ghwanung' gabiikta fuga Yahudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda gweayda madeeda bea sugoocheanda Ajemi siguura Goreshi, gideaba ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi rugu aba ghuuta Yeremiya gaygagul damanda, hean gagatkat NG'UTAMIIDA guroorooda Goresheeda was sugoocheanda Ajemi ak gwarukuta aba jeeda sugoocheanduumeadaanyi sean nea ghwayiin eara jeeda ng'ooruutka: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gwayi Goreshi was sugoocheanda Ajemi, ‘NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA humng'eeda, ninyakneani sugoocheanduumeeda ng'eanyiida, ak ea ninyakneani gadiyeeda jea dadeeksa niny gheeda aba Yerusalemu, was Yuda. Asi gilinyoo gwanda jeedeang'wa was fugaaschi, NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI gagasa gwandeayi sea niny. Anung' gwadiyeada.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
